### 3. Problem Statement

Students often face difficulties understanding complex academic topics, solving doubts, preparing notes, and getting quick explanations during exam preparation. Traditional learning methods may not always provide personalized support or instant responses.

Therefore, there is a need for an AI-powered educational platform that provides instant academic assistance, simplifies difficult concepts, generates study notes, and supports students in effective learning.

### 4. Proposed Solution

EduGenie is a web-based AI educational assistant powered by Google Gemini API. It provides students with an interactive platform to ask academic questions and receive clear, accurate, and easy-to-understand answers.

The system helps students generate notes, summarize study materials, clarify doubts, and prepare for examinations through AI-powered learning support.

