### 9. Expected Outcome

The expected outcome is a functional web-based educational platform that acts as a virtual learning assistant. Students will be able to interact with the AI chatbot, generate notes, summarize content, and receive academic guidance through a simple and interactive interface.

### 10. Conclusion

The brainstorming and ideation phase helped identify the major learning challenges faced by students and develop EduGenie as a potential AI-based solution. The project aims to make learning easier, faster, more interactive, and accessible through Google Gemini AI.

